    wq#3351: autoclear plug-derived rows of unreachable nodes
    
    aq_autoclear only cleared rows of SSH-collected nodes, but <node>:zombie
    fires only while the node is unreachable, so it could never clear.
    aq#1568 seshat:zombie (plug back at 0W) sat open/high/unowned; sla_sweep
    counted it every cycle and probe-storage-integrity FAILed 634x (aq#1482).
    Plug keys (zombie, watts) now clear on a fresh numeric plug reading.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

